# Admin qovluğunun qorunması
<FilesMatch "^(config\.php|config\.sample\.php|db\.php|schema\.php|seed\.php|lib\.php|turnstile\.php|import\.php|content-pack\.php)$">
    Require all denied
</FilesMatch>
<FilesMatch "\.(json|sql|sqlite|bak)$">
    Require all denied
</FilesMatch>
Options -Indexes
DirectoryIndex index.php
